@page "/platform/adventures-companion"

<PageTitle>Adventures Companion | Adventures Studio</PageTitle>

<main class="companion-page">
    <section class="companion-hero">
        <span class="companion-hero__eyebrow">
            Adventures Studio
        </span>

        <h1>
            Meet Adventures Companion.
        </h1>

        <p class="companion-hero__lead">
            A future travel companion designed to help you dream, plan, experience,
            capture, remember, and share every adventure with confidence.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="companion-section">
        <h2>A trusted guide for the entire journey</h2>

        <p>
            Adventures Companion will bring together destination inspiration,
            personalized planning, reservations, real-time travel support, optional
            location-based features, journaling, photography, video, and memory
            preservation in one connected experience.
        </p>

        <p>
            The goal is simple: spend less time managing travel and more time
            experiencing it.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="companion-capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
        <div class="companion-capabilities__header">
            <span class="companion-section__eyebrow">
                Future capabilities
            </span>

            <h2 id="capabilities-title">
                Before, during, and long after every adventure.
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="companion-capabilities__grid">
            <article>
                <h3>Plan</h3>
                <p>
                    Build personalized itineraries, organize transportation,
                    manage reservations, and prepare with confidence.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>Experience</h3>
                <p>
                    Access daily plans, offline information, maps, recommendations,
                    and travel details while exploring.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>Capture</h3>
                <p>
                    Create journal entries, voice notes, blogs, vlogs, photos,
                    videos, and an optional GPS-powered adventure timeline.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>Remember</h3>
                <p>
                    Turn the journey into maps, timelines, digital keepsakes,
                    photo books, and stories worth preserving.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="companion-trust">
        <span class="companion-section__eyebrow">
            Built around trust
        </span>

        <h2>Your adventure. Your information. Your choice.</h2>

        <p>
            Features such as location tracking, travel history, journals, and
            sharing will always be optional, transparent, and controlled by the
            customer.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="companion-status">
        <h2>Coming in a future release</h2>

        <p>
            Adventures Companion is part of the long-term Adventures Studio
            platform vision. The current destination experience is laying the
            foundation for what comes next.
        </p>

        <a href="/">
            Return home
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
    </section>
</main>